<h2 class="bold" id="accessibility"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="file#accessibility">Accessibility</a></h2>
<p>Bootsted implementation changes the input label text to the file name of selected file. Once user selects a file, they loose the context and therefore this implementation is considered bad usability and violates at least one WCAG success criterion - <a href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG21/Understanding/labels-or-instructions.html" class="underline">3.3.2 Labels or Instructions - Level A</a>.</p>
